This game started really good with an early wish from an Lamp in the
gnomish mines. (GDSM)

Later on gnomish Mines i transformed my Pet in an Trap, until it was an
Silver Dragon. (Which i just left alone much later in Gehennom, as it
was too slow and I was strong enough, to do it without an Pet)

And to my Luck the Grayswandir was granted by Quetzalcouatl at the
Minetown Altar. (Second Weapon came from Guards Captain)

Sokoban was Amulet of reflection.

Between Sokoban and Castle i found an "genocide-Throne", which i used
for Disenchanters. (I dont remeber, when i found the scroll for Liches)

I did my Quest before the Castle and on Castle Level my Ascension Kit was
complete! (With good luck on robe-enchantment, as i enchanted it one
time too much)

Run to get the Amulet was pretty straight. (I could cast Magic Mapping
on every Level an pick-axe an direct way for the Way back fast)
Problems came later only on plane of Air (Elementals) and Astral Plane.
The mysterious Force was really fair to me, wit only 5 random Teleports. 

After this ascension i ask myself, why Archaeologists are considered to
be one of the harder Roles, as after some years of Nethack-abstinence my
18th Char, an Archaeologist was first (and quite easy) ascension. 

Current follower-Char is an Rogue. (Right now killed medusa, but lost
pet due to petrification)
I hope, I can ascend him in February. (Play most time in train while
driven to and from work) 

